# Group Project

@body

- [*Week 0, Nov 5:* Describe the group project.]{color=#666666}
- [*Week 1, Nov 12:* Groups formed.]{color=#666666}
- [*Week 2, Nov 19 (Today): Pick a single biotechnology company product.*]{color=#D40000}
  - Complete the Company Vision Report (Form) to record your choice.
- *Week 3, Nov 26:* No class, Thanksgiving.
- *Week 4, Dec 3:* Group Project Discussion.
- [*Week 5, Dec 10:*]{color=#D40000} Group Presentation.
- [*Week 6, Dec 17:*]{color=#D40000} Submit the Group Business Plan (due finals week).

=== layout: one-panel

# Group Projects

@body

- 1. Form the group; Decide on Product
- 2. Vision report
  - Any changes to the company now that you are bringing in new talent.
  - Your choice\: New name? New market? Expand product offering? More specifics into the science, etc.
- 3. Group Presentation
  - Dive more into the science
  - Longer presentation
- 4. Group Business Plan
  - Dive more into the science
  - Put it all together in one final document

